# Stack currency (verify before coding)

Do not write framework code from memory. If you cannot verify a call against current docs, say so and mark the line to confirm.

Nothing is version-pinned yet. Pin versions when the project is scaffolded, and add a row here when a stale API is caught.

| Stale or guessed | Current for this project | Why |
|------------------|--------------------------|-----|
| Sentinel Hub on `services.sentinel-hub.com` | `https://sh.dataspace.copernicus.eu/statistics/v1` and the CDSE identity token URL | Copernicus Data Space is the account this product uses |
| MCP over stdio, or SSE as the default | Remote streamable HTTP at `/mcp` | Amazon Quick connects to remote servers only and prefers streamable HTTP |
| `"required": true` inside a property | `"required": ["name"]` at the schema root | Quick rejects JSON Schema draft 3 |
| `ST_Area(geom)` in degrees | `ST_Area(geom::geography) / 10000` | Geodesic hectares, EQ-001 |
| `export const runtime = 'edge'` | Node.js runtime | Edge runtime is deprecated on Vercel; this project is not on the edge |

When a computed number is involved, cite its `EQ-###` from `docs/methods.md` and carry a confidence. Do not invent a bare number.
